Per phase (alternating trace):

| Policy | quiet miss % | busy miss % | quiet mean q | busy mean q | reaction s | recovery s |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| fixed q=1 | 0.0 | 0.0 | 1.00 | 1.00 | – | – |
| fixed q=2 | 0.0 | 0.0 | 2.00 | 2.00 | – | – |
