| constant | adaptive | 40.3 | 18.67 | 0/3/54/43 | 2.5 | 5016 |
| constant | no-damping ablation | 44.0 | 20.17 | 0/2/22/76 | 3.3 | 5548 |

A reversal is q going up then down (or down then up). Many reversals = oscillation.

